{
  "_comment": "Takeover fingerprints. `cname` = regexes matched against any name in the CNAME chain. `nxdomain` = true when a CNAME to this service whose target no longer exists can be claimed by registering the same resource name. `http` = response-body strings shown when the resource is unclaimed. `status`: vulnerable = known claimable; edge = claimable only in some configurations, verify manually. Services change their behaviour over time; review against the community list at https://github.com/EdOverflow/can-i-take-over-xyz when updating.",
